Description: Remove enterprise provider calls from Sync Status chart

This patch removes Google Workspace and Microsoft Entra provider sync status
checks from the admin dashboard, since these enterprise providers are not
available in the OSS build.

Only SCIM (OSS), LDAP, and Kerberos sync sources remain in the dashboard.

Author: Matthew Ramirez <matthew.ramirez@chainguard.dev>
Forwarded: not-needed

diff --git a/web/src/admin/admin-overview/charts/SyncStatusChart.ts b/web/src/admin/admin-overview/charts/SyncStatusChart.ts
